&lt;h2 id=&#34;about-tavern-tussle&#34;&gt;About Tavern Tussle&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;video src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/videos/taverntussle/steamvid1.webm&#34; autoplay muted loop&gt;&lt;/video&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the tavern, adventurer. We’ve noticed you haven’t been paying off your tab, so buckle up; it’s time to pay it off the hard way! Compete against your adventuring party in a series of frantic minigames to entertain the tavern and pay off your debt. Or be turned into a frog. Your choice.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
